


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_577ed1a3:



    voice "2FU_1006"
    fumi "「修了好久了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_5c70f76a:


    "从车窗洒进来的夕阳晃得文眯起了眼睛。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_e7656e7c:


    "两人坐在返回宿舍的公交车上，但车从刚才开始就没动过。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_67e78c59:


    "公交车在坡道上引擎故障了，现在司机打开了车盖，正在紧急维修。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_efe57bcb:



    voice "2HI_1261"
    hina "「可能还要等一会吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_38d766e4:



    voice "2FU_1007"
    fumi "「那我们下车走回去吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_8cdd1ee4:



    voice "2HI_1262"
    hina "「不，没事。小文在我身边就好」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_a2173a70:



    voice "2FU_1008"
    fumi "「嗯，那就这样靠在一起」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_5121c111:


    "乘客只有她们两个人，稍微亲热一下也没关系的吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_278c7e29:


    "……………"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_57350033:


    "二人聊起今天打工的事。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_9bc57866:


    "今天客人意料之中的没上周末那么多，但这次妈妈不在，平均下来要干的活多了，反而更忙一些。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_1c67c6e5:


    "但就算这样，熟悉工作后的阳菜工作的比上次还要卖力，负责接待和收银的文也是直到关店前都保持着笑容。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_5f9e4864:


    "靠两人无与伦比的青春活力度过了这次难关。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_7c0d5043:


    "当然爸爸也给了比上次还多的酬劳，不止是打工钱，还拿到了蛋糕吃。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_f3b8ca2c:


    "但是……"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_eca2693f:



    voice "2HI_1263"
    hina "「那条围巾好可惜啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_b6d3b9ce:


    "现在两个人正一起围着文的围巾。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_1978e8ef:


    "在要上车的时候，阳菜的围巾被一阵风刮跑了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_5abc2dfe:



    voice "2HI_1264"
    hina "「那条可是小文织给我的啊。当时我应该去追回来的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_b016482b:



    voice "2FU_1009"
    fumi "「不可以，阳菜肯定会和上次追羽毛那次一样追到天涯海角的吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_193c4a3b:



    voice "2HI_1265"
    hina "「唔」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_4722e812:


    "无法反驳。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_5a558e33:



    voice "2HI_1266"
    hina "「那我就当那个是让我俩能像这样靠在一起的车票好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_e6772231:



    voice "2FU_1010"
    fumi "「呵呵，或许是呢。我会再给你织条围巾的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_97824bb2:


    "两人更加贴近彼此。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_f7adf7e6:


    "犹如苦中作乐一般，两人找回了原本的积极的思考模式。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_5165a511:



    voice "2HI_1267"
    hina "「我在休息时间和爸爸通了电话」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_77ea120e:



    voice "2FU_1011"
    fumi "「哎，这样吗？告诉我的话，我还能道谢下呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_402404b3:



    voice "2HI_1268"
    hina "「不用不用，而且我也有告诉他」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_5c08a1a9:



    voice "2FU_1012RE"
    fumi "「我想亲自表达下谢意！还害阳菜今天请了假……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_d7268124:


    "看来文一直在意着这个事。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_c01fbed9:



    voice "2HI_1269"
    hina "「反正因为上次发烧拿不了全勤奖了，再多请一天也不算什么」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_5c569a03:



    voice "2FU_1013"
    fumi "「……那次也是因为我」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_79dce206:



    voice "2HI_1270"
    hina "「所以都说了不是小文的错」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_d4a94d9a:



    voice "2FU_1014"
    fumi "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_adff0c08:



    voice "2HI_1271"
    hina "「嗯，说到哪了……对对，我姐姐要结婚了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_8a2a4887:



    voice "2FU_1015"
    fumi "「哎？哇！恭、恭喜！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_4500f1fb:



    voice "2HI_1272"
    hina "「对方是比她大3岁的白领」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_314b7f56:



    voice "2FU_1016"
    fumi "「工作认识的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_cf85f1b2:



    voice "2HI_1273"
    hina "「好像是，虽说我还没见过那人呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_eb366e98:



    voice "2FU_1017"
    fumi "「你爸爸很开心吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_595dda59:



    voice "2HI_1274"
    hina "「哈哈哈，毕竟是父女，应该心情蛮复杂的？还说什么阳菜也迟早会嫁出去的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_ea161ad5:



    voice "2FU_1018"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_fb4b0fee:



    voice "2HI_1275"
    hina "「然后我就和爸爸说了。说我现在有女朋友呀」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_ece9f70f:



    voice "2FU_1019"
    fumi "「……！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_a82867e5:



    voice "2HI_1276"
    hina "「就是我今天去帮忙的浅生家的小文」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_2b7efcf1:



    voice "2FU_1020RE"
    fumi "「……然后你爸爸怎么说？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_5e6bf860:



    voice "2HI_1277"
    hina "「他笑了，然后问我将来是要和小文结婚吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_180c07ed:



    voice "2FU_1021"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_9dd5b52f:



    voice "2HI_1278"
    hina "「我说要，绝对要结」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_d000392c:



    voice "2FU_1022"
    fumi "「……阳菜」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_267a0510:



    voice "2HI_1279"
    hina "「然后我爸就说，那你今天可要好好表现，让未来的老丈人还有丈母娘对你满意才行」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_14ce1641:



    voice "2HI_1280"
    hina "「所以我就拼命努力工作了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_abab21e4:


    "阳菜挺胸说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_14e1d601:



    voice "2FU_1023"
    fumi "「谢——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_f64e3704:



    voice "2FU_1024"
    fumi "「…………！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_80226576:


    "阳菜的手贴到文的脸颊上。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_67c341f9:



    voice "2HI_1281"
    hina "「请永远和我在一起」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_f3c1d7fa:



    voice "2FU_1025"
    fumi "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_d01057e5:



    voice "2HI_1282"
    hina "「我会努力的，做到让我和小文喜欢的人都来为我们祝福」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_d7e1b087:



    voice "2FU_1026"
    fumi "「我也……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_076bf066:


    "两人的脸互相凑近。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_7a7594f8:



    voice "2HI_1283"
    hina "「嗯……哈啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_ffb7c058:



    voice "2FU_1027"
    fumi "「啊……嗯嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_fd45a72b:


    "风平浪静，只是唇齿交叠的轻吻。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_629d6abd:


    "今后还有数不胜数的亲吻等着二人。但大概，现在这个吻是最特别的，一辈子无法遗忘的。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_785ac2bc:



    voice "2HI_1284"
    hina "「小……文…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_ef02765c:



    voice "2FU_1028"
    fumi "「嗯……阳……菜」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_2d31cf2b:


    "引擎发动后车身震动起来，两人轻轻地离开彼此。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_e11b9019:


    "司机上了车，告知可以出发了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_6eb1df3d:



    voice "2FU_1029"
    fumi "「可能我们俩至今都是只看着脚下一步一步走过来的。所以对除此之外的一切毫无了解」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_d12b1b2f:



    voice "2HI_1285"
    hina "「但是抬起头时却发现可以看到远方？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_3150050a:



    voice "2FU_1030"
    fumi "「嗯，为眼前瞬间剧变的景象惊到了，但是也正因此看到了好多好多事物」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_b3bb57d5:



    voice "2HI_1286"
    hina "「我们有没有稍微成长了些呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_b7cfabc9:



    voice "2FU_1031"
    fumi "「哼哼，稍微一点点」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_80beffdd:


    "文忽然抱住阳菜的手臂，阳菜被这一突然的举动稍微吓到了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_fbedf201:



    voice "2FU_1032"
    fumi "「等我们回去后，做大人的事情吧♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_31960011:



    voice "2HI_1287"
    hina "「啊……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_3e2ad5c5:


    "公交车开始行驶。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_776be3ce:


    "两人长远的旅途才刚刚开始。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_dda04b65:


    "只要那笑容依在，无论什么样的困难，两人都可以跨越。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_b0663366:


    "不再为关系何时结束而恐惧，而是相信可以相伴彼此直到永远。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_da197fcd:


    "从今以后的无数个冬日，两人都会一同度过。"




translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_e7e27227:


    voice "2FU_1012RE"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_07_90da9b62:


    fumi "「我想亲自表达下谢意！还害阳菜今天请了假……」"
